{"id": 2392, "title": "Two Daughters", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "two-daughters", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2392_two-daughters.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["一位老太太有两个女儿，大女儿卖草帽，二女儿卖雨伞，老太太每天愁眉苦脸的。", "一位邻居问她为什么。老太太说：“下雨天，我担心大女儿的遮阳草帽卖不出去；可是等天晴了吧，我又担心二女儿的雨伞卖不出去，你说我能不发愁吗？”", "邻居听完笑着说：“一到下雨天，您二女儿的雨伞就卖得特别好；天一晴，您大女儿的店里顾客就会变多。无论天晴还是下雨都好，真让人羡慕呀！”", "看事情的方式决定了你的生活质量，积极乐观的生活态度才是最重要的。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["一位老太太有兩個女兒，大女兒賣草帽，二女兒賣雨傘，老太太每天愁眉苦臉的。", "一位鄰居問她為什麼。老太太說：“下雨天，我擔心大女兒的遮陽草帽賣不出去；可是等天晴了吧，我又擔心二女兒的雨傘賣不出去，你說我能不發愁嗎？”", "鄰居聽完笑著說：“一到下雨天，您二女兒的雨傘就賣得特別好；天一晴，您大女兒的店裡顧客就會變多。無論天晴還是下雨都好，真讓人羨慕呀！”", "看事情的方式決定了你的生活質量，積極樂觀的生活態度才是最重要的。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yī wèi lǎo tài tai yǒu liǎng gè nǚ ér， dà nǚ ér mài cǎo mào， èr nǚ ér mài yǔ sǎn， lǎo tài tai měi tiān chóu méi kǔ liǎn de。", "yī wèi lín jū wèn tā wèi shén me。 lǎo tài tai shuō：“ xià yǔ tiān， wǒ dān xīn dà nǚ ér de zhē yáng cǎo mào mài bù chū qù； kě shì děng tiān qíng le ba， wǒ yòu dān xīn èr nǚ ér de yǔ sǎn mài bù chū qù， nǐ shuō wǒ néng bù fā chóu ma？”", "lín jū tīng wán xiào zhe shuō：“ yī dào xià yǔ tiān， nín èr nǚ ér de yǔ sǎn jiù mài de tè bié hǎo； tiān yī qíng， nín dà nǚ ér de diàn lǐ gù kè jiù huì biàn duō。 wú lùn tiān qíng hái shi xià yǔ dōu hǎo， zhēn ràng rén xiàn mù ya！”", "kàn shì qing de fāng shì jué dìng le nǐ de shēng huó zhì liàng， jī jí lè guān de shēng huó tài dù cái shì zuì zhòng yào de。"], "english_paragraphs": ["An elderly woman had two daughters. Her older daughter sold straw sun hats, and her younger daughter sold umbrellas. The woman looked worried every day.", "A neighbor asked her why. The woman said, “When it rains, I worry that my older daughter won’t be able to sell her sun hats. But when the sun comes out, I worry that my younger daughter won’t be able to sell her umbrellas. How could I not worry?”", "The neighbor smiled and said, “Whenever it rains, your younger daughter’s umbrellas sell especially well. And when the sun comes out, more customers visit your older daughter’s shop. Whether it’s sunny or rainy, things work out well for them. How enviable!”", "The way you look at things determines your quality of life. What matters most is having a positive, optimistic attitude."], "english_full": "An elderly woman had two daughters. Her older daughter sold straw sun hats, and her younger daughter sold umbrellas. The woman looked worried every day.\n\nA neighbor asked her why. The woman said, “When it rains, I worry that my older daughter won’t be able to sell her sun hats. But when the sun comes out, I worry that my younger daughter won’t be able to sell her umbrellas. How could I not worry?”\n\nThe neighbor smiled and said, “Whenever it rains, your younger daughter’s umbrellas sell especially well. And when the sun comes out, more customers visit your older daughter’s shop. Whether it’s sunny or rainy, things work out well for them. How enviable!”\n\nThe way you look at things determines your quality of life. What matters most is having a positive, optimistic attitude.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi\" data-defn=\"classifier for people (honorific)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">位</span><span class=\"tr\">位</span><rt>wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo tài tai\" data-defn=\"elderly lady (respectful) / esteemed mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">老太太</span><span class=\"tr\">老太太</span><rt>lǎo tài tai</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ ér\" data-defn=\"daughter\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà\" data-defn=\"big; large; great / older (than another person) / eldest\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ ér\" data-defn=\"daughter\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mài\" data-defn=\"to sell\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">卖</span><span class=\"tr\">賣</span><rt>mài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cǎo mào\" data-defn=\"straw hat\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">草帽</span><span class=\"tr\">草帽</span><rt>cǎo mào</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"èr\" data-defn=\"two / 2\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">二</span><span class=\"tr\">二</span><rt>èr</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ ér\" data-defn=\"daughter\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mài\" data-defn=\"to sell\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">卖</span><span class=\"tr\">賣</span><rt>mài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǔ sǎn\" data-defn=\"umbrella\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">雨伞</span><span class=\"tr\">雨傘</span><rt>yǔ sǎn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo tài tai\" data-defn=\"elderly lady (respectful) / esteemed mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">老太太</span><span class=\"tr\">老太太</span><rt>lǎo tài tai</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"měi\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tiān\" data-defn=\"day\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chóu méi kǔ liǎn\" data-defn=\"to look anxious (idiom) / to look miserable\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">愁眉苦脸</span><span class=\"tr\">愁眉苦臉</span><rt>chóu méi kǔ liǎn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"emphatic particle (used at the end of a declarative sentence for emphasis)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi\" data-defn=\"classifier for people (honorific)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">位</span><span class=\"tr\">位</span><rt>wèi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lín jū\" data-defn=\"neighbor\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">邻居</span><span class=\"tr\">鄰居</span><rt>lín jū</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèn\" data-defn=\"to ask; to inquire\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">问</span><span class=\"tr\">問</span><rt>wèn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi shén me\" data-defn=\"why? / for what reason?\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">为什么</span><span class=\"tr\">為什麼</span><rt>wèi shén me</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo tài tai\" data-defn=\"elderly lady (respectful) / esteemed mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">老太太</span><span class=\"tr\">老太太</span><rt>lǎo tài tai</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby>：“<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xià\" data-defn=\"to decline / to go down\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǔ\" data-defn=\"rain\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">雨</span><span class=\"tr\">雨</span><rt>yǔ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tiān\" data-defn=\"day\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dān xīn\" data-defn=\"to worry / to be anxious\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">担心</span><span class=\"tr\">擔心</span><rt>dān xīn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà\" data-defn=\"big; large; great / older (than another person) / eldest\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ ér\" data-defn=\"daughter\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"emphatic particle (used at the end of a declarative sentence for emphasis)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhē yáng\" data-defn=\"to shield from the sun\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">遮阳</span><span class=\"tr\">遮陽</span><rt>zhē yáng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cǎo mào\" data-defn=\"straw hat\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">草帽</span><span class=\"tr\">草帽</span><rt>cǎo mào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mài\" data-defn=\"to sell\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">卖</span><span class=\"tr\">賣</span><rt>mài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-